      "writtenOn": "2026-09-14T12:17:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We want to improve Skia memory safety for both Chrome, Android, and even Chrome on Android ;-)\n\nLGTM for the unused variable.\n\n---\n\nNote that only Flutter is using the Skia GN config. Not even Chrome is using the Skia GN config despite Chrome using GN itself.",
